        "body": "={{ {\n  model: \"llama-3.3-70b-versatile\",\n  messages: [\n    {\n      role: \"system\",\n      content: \"You are an expert Indian automotive advisor. You MUST use the live web data provided. Never make up prices. If the data mentions a price, use it exactly. Format your answer with clear headings and bullet points.\"\n    },\n    {\n      role: \"user\",\n      content: `CUSTOMER PROFILE:\nName: ${$json.name}\nBudget: ${$json.Budget} lakh\nCar Type Wanted: ${$json.Type}\nPurpose: ${$json.Purpose}\n\n=== LIVE WEB SEARCH DATA (Use this for real prices) ===\n${$json.wag_search_context}\n\n=== LATEST NEWS & LAUNCHES (Use this for new models) ===\n${$json.wag_news_context}\n\nTASK: Based strictly on the live data above, recommend the TOP 3 best ${$json.Type} cars in India under ${$json.Budget} lakh for ${$json.Purpose}.\nFor each car give: Model name, exact on-road price from data, top 3 features, and pros/cons.\nIf a price is not in the data, say \"Price: Check latest at dealership\".`\n    }\n  ],\n  temperature: 0.4\n} }}",
